        "title": "fix(parallel-mcp): use truncateUtf16Safe for error message truncation",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nThree `.slice(0, 500)` truncation sites in the Parallel MCP search extension may cut UTF-16 surrogate pairs in half when the error payload contains multi-byte characters such as emoji.\n\n## Changes\n\n- `extensions/parallel/src/parallel-mcp-search.runtime.ts`: replace all three `JSON.stringify(...).slice(0, 500)` with `truncateUtf16Safe(JSON.stringify(...), 500)`.\n\nLabel: bugfix | merge-risk: 🟢 minimal",
